.TH DANBY-FLIGHT 1
.SH NAME
danby-flight \- coupled longitudinal aircraft dynamics
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B danby/flight
.SH MODEL
Speed and flight-path angle follow thrust, lift, drag, mass, and gravity.
Aircraft pitch and pitch rate form a coupled attitude-control mode; angle of
attack is the difference between pitch and flight-path angle.
.SH DISPLAY
The aircraft drawing follows integrated pitch.  Altitude and airspeed are
plotted against time.
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/danby/plugin/flight.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR mechanism (2)
